# FontFix follow-up: the NPC speech balloon of Peach in Delfino Plaza (message 0xE004F of common/2d/balloon.bmg).
# NpcBase.cpp:133-141 creates the TNpcBalloon only for the Peach NPC (mActorType 0x4000018) and only when
# getCurrentMap() == 1 and getCurrentStage() == 1, i.e. Delfino Plaza. NpcChange.cpp:242-255: taking her calls
# peachParasolOut_() and setNextMessage(0xE004F, 0x2EE), so the balloon appears 750 logic ticks (25 s) later.
# Peach's node in dolpic/0 (/map/scene.bin, name ピーチ): position (5350, 300, 4200), facing 180 deg.
# The dev start puts Mario at (6500, 300, -3850), about 8050 units away, so this route teleports next to her
# (a tp, not retail input) and presses A.
# Run: python tools/route.py Strict2 tools/routes/99_talk_text_peach.dev --name peach_b43 --seconds 300
#   SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_SEED=1 SUNSHINE_RENDER_SCALE=1
#   settings.ini [video] fsr1=0 widescreen=1 aspect=4:3
# Evidence: pe_*.png (the balloon text), the talk= field in run.log (1 while she is held), 0 fatal, rc of the run.
# Measured 2026-10-14, run peach_b43d (rc 0, 0 fatal, 0x2E ticks): Mario takes Peach (she rides on him) and her
# dialogue banner is fully legible at the top (マリオ! ぶじでよかったわ) - that is the NPC speech path, not the balloon.
# The balloon 0xE004F (ゆうかい デス！ in common/2d/balloon.bmg) does NOT appear, not even 1800 ticks (30 s) after the
# take: panel-coloured pixels are 3 in every pe_a*.png, the count of a frame without a balloon.
# Most likely cause: TBaseNPC::loadAfter (NpcBase.cpp:133-141) creates the TNpcBalloon only when
# getCurrentMap() == 1 and getCurrentStage() == 1, and a dolpic/0 dev start does not satisfy that (the devscript status
# prints gpApplication.mCurrArea.getStage() = 1, which is the area, not the director's map/stage).
# Next attempt, not run: take her during a real entry into Delfino Plaza (route 85 reaches the plaza with the accepted
# dev aids), not a dev start.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=6000
cheat infinite_health
wait frames=30
log
tp x=5350 y=320 z=4400 yaw=180
wait frames=10
shot pe_tp000.png
hold A frames=60
wait frames=30
log
